WEBVTT

00:05.800 --> 00:07.040
General Zu Kun's return to court

00:07.160 --> 00:08.440
Is for official business

00:08.520 --> 00:09.840
Should not be mixed with personal interests

00:09.920 --> 00:11.000
If I prepare a gift

00:11.080 --> 00:12.747
It would seem too deliberate

00:16.040 --> 00:17.440
You have vision

00:17.520 --> 00:19.240
As expected of Prince of Jin

00:19.320 --> 00:19.920
This way

00:20.040 --> 00:22.373
Our whole family won't have to suffer

